B.YP=new A.bq("The LmunA App does not collect, use or share personal data, without the permission of the user. In this privacy policy, the term 'chair' refers to the head of a committee at the conference. The term 'OC' refers to the Organizing Commitee of the conference. If you have any questions, you can always contact us.",null,B.cE,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
B.YQ=new A.bq("\u2022Information You Provide: We collect the information chairs with a 'portal code' enter into the 'Chair Portal' for the help requests. This includes any text that the authorized chair enters into the textfield. No other personal data is collected. The requests that the chair submits can be viewed and deleted by the Organizing Committee. Names and other personal information should not be shared; instead, chairs should only share short and relevant information. Chairs can cancel their request at any time by tapping the 'trash' button, and it will be completely removed. The Organizing Committee reserves the right to remove requests and may block portals code if chairs abuse this function.\n\n\u2022FirebaseMessaging: We use FirebaseMessaging to send push notifications. However, we do not collect or store personal data related to these notifications.\n\n\u2022Contentful: We use Contentful to load images and texts for the app. This service doesn't collect any personal information about the users.",null,B.cE,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
